<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.request.reads ~ a request's receipt, read without dispatching

`lares vessel request <requestId>` reads a verb request's receipt and dispatches nothing. `cancel=true` withdraws it before it is read: the operator's own withdrawal, marking the id abandoned so a later line under it refuses; no automated path sends it on a timeout.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ read · cancel

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`read` params=`request/<requestId> ~ read the receipt`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`cancel` params=`request/<requestId> cancel/true ~ withdraw it`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ request · cancel

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`request` params=`takes/id needs/required seat/1 as/<requestId> ~ the request id`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`cancel` params=`kind/switch ~ withdraw the request before it is read`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand ~ cancel=true stays the operator's own withdrawal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · daemon-unreachable · cancel-lost · verb-error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[engine.request.reads request/<requestId>]] ~ name the request id`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`daemon-unreachable` params=`~ no daemon answers; lares vessel stand foreground=true`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`cancel-lost` params=`~ the request ran before the cancel landed`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`verb-error` params=`~ the vessel answered a fault`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ ok

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`ok` params=`exit/0 ~ the receipt, or the withdrawal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

